一切值得记下的东西。\n\n笔记均来自日常学习，持续更新中。\n","updated":"2026-09-15T12:23:25.417Z","path":"about/index.html","comments":1,"layout":"page","_id":"cmu2ndta70000boax37bp33iy","content":"<h1 id=\"关于我\"><a href=\"#关于我\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于我\"></a>关于我</h1><p>这里是「网络安全学院学习笔记」，记录每天的学习内容：网络安全、CTF、编程与一切值得记下的东西。</p>\n<p>笔记均来自日常学习，持续更新中。</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h1 id=\"关于我\"><a href=\"#关于我\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于我\"></a>关于我</h1><p>这里是「网络安全学院学习笔记」，记录每天的学习内容：网络安全、CTF、编程与一切值得记下的东西。</p>\n<p>笔记均来自日常学习，持续更新中。</p>\n"},{"title":"tags","date":"2026-09-15T12:21:56.000Z","type":"tags","comments":0,"_content":"","source":"tags/index.md","raw":"---\ntitle: tags\ndate: 2026-09-15 20:21:56\ntype: tags\ncomments: false\n---\n","updated":"2026-09-15T12:23:25.356Z","path":"tags/index.html","layout":"page","_id":"cmu2ndtam0002boaxgzwf6bj0","content":"","excerpt":"","more":""},{"title":"categories","date":"2026-09-15T12:21:58.000Z","type":"categories","comments":0,"_content":"","source":"categories/index.md","raw":"---\ntitle: categories\ndate: 2026-09-15 20:21:58\ntype: categories\ncomments: false\n---\n","updated":"2026-09-15T12:23:25.386Z","path":"categories/index.html","layout":"page","_id":"cmu2ndtat0004boax2ake3ele","content":"","excerpt":"","more":""}],"Post":[{"title":"我的第一篇学习笔记","date":"2026-09-15T12:23:49.000Z","_content":"\n这是从 Trilium 导出后自动发布的示例文章，用来验证整条发布流程。\n\n## 今天学了什么\n\n- Hexo 博客搭建\n- GitHub Pages 部署\n- Markdown 基础语法\n\n## 待办\n\n- [ ] 把 Trilium 里的旧笔记陆续导出\n- [ ] 坚持每天一篇\n\n> 从 Trilium 导出：选中笔记 → 右键 Export as Markdown → 保存到 `_notes/` 目录。\n","source":"_posts/20260915-我的第一篇学习笔记.md","raw":"---\ntitle: \"我的第一篇学习笔记\"\ndate: 2026-09-15 20:23:49\ncategories:\n  - 学习笔记\ntags: []\n---\n\n这是从 Trilium 导出后自动发布的示例文章，用来验证整条发布流程。\n\n## 今天学了什么\n\n- Hexo 博客搭建\n- GitHub Pages 部署\n- Markdown 基础语法\n\n## 待办\n\n- [ ] 把 Trilium 里的旧笔记陆续导出\n- [ ] 坚持每天一篇\n\n> 从 Trilium 导出：选中笔记 → 右键 Export as Markdown → 保存到 `_notes/` 目录。\n","slug":"20260915-我的第一篇学习笔记","published":1,"updated":"2026-09-15T12:23:49.691Z","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"_id":"cmu2ndtad0001boax3kiw4emp","content":"<p>这是从 Trilium 导出后自动发布的示例文章，用来验证整条发布流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"今天学了什么\"><a href=\"#今天学了什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"今天学了什么\"></a>今天学了什么</h2><ul>\n<li>Hexo 博客搭建</li>\n<li>GitHub Pages 部署</li>\n<li>Markdown 基础语法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"待办\"><a href=\"#待办\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"待办\"></a>待办</h2><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 把 Trilium 里的旧笔记陆续导出</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 坚持每天一篇</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>从 Trilium 导出：选中笔记 → 右键 Export as Markdown → 保存到 <code>_notes/</code> 目录。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>这是从 Trilium 导出后自动发布的示例文章，用来验证整条发布流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"今天学了什么\"><a href=\"#今天学了什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"今天学了什么\"></a>今天学了什么</h2><ul>\n<li>Hexo 博客搭建</li>\n<li>GitHub Pages 部署</li>\n<li>Markdown 基础语法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"待办\"><a href=\"#待办\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"待办\"></a>待办</h2><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 把 Trilium 里的旧笔记陆续导出</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 坚持每天一篇</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>从 Trilium 导出：选中笔记 → 右键 Export as Markdown → 保存到 <code>_notes/</code> 目录。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}],"PostAsset":[],"PostCategory":[{"post_id":"cmu2ndtad0001boax3kiw4emp","category_id":"cmu2ndtaq0003boaxdxre7vcb","_id":"cmu2ndtaw0005boax934r9k7d"}],"PostTag":[],"Tag":[]}}